 "remarks": "Welcome to 201 Highview Avenue, Unit A-1! This beautifully renovated end-unit offers a rare opportunity to own the **only townhome-style residence in the complex**, featuring three levels of living space and a private entrance. Thoughtfully updated throughout, this 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath home features a brand-new kitchen, beautiful new red oak hardwood floors, recessed lighting, and new windows to be installed prior to closing. The main living level provides a comfortable and inviting layout, while the spacious finished lower level offers exceptional flexibility for a family room, home office, gym, or additional entertaining space. Enjoy direct walkout access from the lower level to a private patio, creating a seamless connection to the outdoors. A dedicated laundry room area on the lower level adds everyday convenience. With its desirable end-unit location, private entrance, extensive renovations, and unique three-level layout, this move-in-ready home offers the space and feel of a townhome with the convenience of condominium living. A truly unique offering in Stamford!",
